WEBVTT

00:00:00.351 --> 00:00:13.031
The sign in the top bar, and the menu button in the floating bar, open the menu as a full-height sheet over everything. It keeps what a phone needs from the desktop menu: Needs you, with its count across projects, and the projects.

00:00:13.987 --> 00:00:18.307
A tap on another project switches the whole view to it and closes the sheet.

00:00:21.622 --> 00:00:29.982
The bell counts what waits in every project, and opens the Needs you page. Each entry names its project, and carries the quick replies of the inbox.

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:34.460
A question is answered right there with one tap on its option.

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:47.520
Go to card on an entry of another project opens that card and switches the top bar to its project. Browser Back returns to the page, and the cross on the card lands on that project's list.
